{"expires":1779742156537,"value":{"code":200,"headers":{"etag":"W/\"HGw6el6ws4\"","last-modified":"Mon, 25 May 2026 19:49:16 GMT","cache-control":"max-age=3600"},"body":{"title":"Roles & Permissions","slug":"authentication-roles","tags":["auth","roles","permissions"],"content":"# Roles & Permissions\n\n| Role | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `viewer` | Read-only access to published pages |\n| `editor` | Create and edit pages |\n| `admin` | Full access including user management |\n\n## Assigning Roles\n\nRoles are assigned per workspace. An admin can promote any member:\n\n```http\nPATCH /workspace/members/:userId\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{ \"role\": \"editor\" }\n```\n\n## Middleware\n\nUse the `requireRole` middleware to protect routes:\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineEventHandler(requireRole('editor', async (event) => {\n  // handler logic\n}))\n```\n","body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"h1","props":{"id":"roles-permissions"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Roles & Permissions"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"table","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"thead","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"th","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Role"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"th","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"className":[]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"viewer"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Read-only access to published pages"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"className":[]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"editor"}]}]},{"type":"eleme